## Why This Is Asked
Assesses on-device streaming ASR design with privacy, domain adaptation, and real-time constraints. 

## Key Concepts
- Streaming encoder-decoder models, CTC decoding, lexicon and LM integration
- On-device quantization and energy profiling
- Federated updates with secure aggregation and privacy guarantees
- Drift detection via per-user and per-domain metrics

## Code Example
```javascript
function streamDecode(chunk, state) {
  const features = extractFeatures(chunk);
  const logits = model.encodeDecode(features, state);
  const text = decodeCTC(logits);
  return text;
}
```

